<div class="prose-club">
  <p>Penn Golf Club, with its stunning vista over open countryside, is a perfect venue for parties and family celebrations. Our large dining and function suite includes a parquet dance floor and can be dressed to suit your occasion.</p>
  <p>Our Head Chef Penny will create a mouth-watering menu for you, whatever the size or style of party you're planning, and we will not be beaten on price and quality.</p>
</div>

